                                                "example_id": "d6aa12fd-9785-4d19-a33f-39aa35bf6751",
                                                "sense_id": "9f3e08bc-0b6f-30d4-9a27-0002fa0eadbc",
                                                "text": "No lady goat is safe from criminal assault, even on the Sabbath Day, when there is a genteman goat within three miles to leeward of her and nothing in the way but a fence fourteen feet high[…]"
